## Interface: 16001, 16000
## Title: GatherMate2 (harness stand-in)
## Notes: Not GatherMate2. A small stand-in for tools/harness/flow_gm.py: settings tables, page names, the Profiles tab, the key binding names, the pin menu and two chat lines, shaped like GatherMate2's. It holds none of its English: the flow runs GatherMate2's own libraries and enUS locale files from the installed addon first, and names the locale keys at run time.
## Version: 0

